# 基础词 Unit15
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-基础词
# 描述: 基础词Unit15核心词汇

{{demand}}{/dɪˈmɑːnd/}{{v./n. 要求；需求}}{{There is a growing demand for organic food.}}
{{democracy}}{/dɪˈmɒkrəsi/}}n. 民主；民主制度}}{{Democracy allows citizens to participate in government decisions.}}
{{demonstrate}}{/ˈdemənstreɪt/}}v. 证明；演示；示威}}{{The experiment demonstrates the原理clearly.}}
{{dense}}{/dens/}}adj. 密集的；浓密的}}{{The forest is very dense and difficult to walk through.}}
{{deny}}{/dɪˈnaɪ/}}v. 否认；拒绝}}{{He denied all the accusations against him.}}
{{department}}{/dɪˈpɑːrtmənt/}}n. 部门；系}}{{She works in the marketing department of the company.}}
{{depend}}{/dɪˈpend/}}v. 依靠；取决于}}{{The outcome depends on many different factors.}}
{{deposit}}{/dɪˈpɒzɪt/}}n. 存款；押金；v. 存放}}{{You need to pay a deposit when you rent an apartment.}}
{{depress}}{/dɪˈpres/}}v. 使沮丧；压下}}{{The bad news depressed everyone in the office.}}
{{deprive}}{/dɪˈpraɪv/}}v. 剥夺；使丧失}}{{The war deprived many children of their education.}}
{{describe}}{/dɪˈskraɪb/}}v. 描述；形容}}{{Can you describe what happened that night?}}
{{desert}}{/ˈdezərt/}}n. 沙漠；v. 抛弃}}{{The Sahara is the largest hot desert in the world.}}
{{deserve}}{/dɪˈzɜːrv/}}v. 值得；应得}}{{She deserves a promotion for her hard work.}}
{{design}}{/dɪˈzaɪn/}}n. 设计；v. 设计}}{{The architect designed a modern and sustainable building.}}
{{desire}}{/dɪˈzaɪər/}}n. 欲望；渴望；v. 渴望}}{{He has a strong desire to succeed in his career.}}
{{desk}}{/desk/}}n. 书桌；办公桌}}{{She sat at her desk and开始work.}}
{{desperate}}{/ˈdespərət/}}adj. 绝望的；不顾一切的}}{{The desperate situation called for immediate action.}}
{{despite}}{/dɪˈspaɪt/}}prep. 尽管；不管}}{{Despite the rain, we enjoyed the outdoor concert.}}
{{destroy}}{/dɪˈstrɔɪ/}}v. 破坏；毁灭}}{{The earthquake destroyed many buildings in the city.}}
{{detail}}{/ˈdiːteɪl/}}n. 细节；详情；v. 详述}}{{Please pay attention to every detail of the contract.}}
{{detect}}{/dɪˈtekt/}}v. 发现；察觉}}{{The sensor can detect even the slightest change in temperature.}}
{{determine}}{/dɪˈtɜːrmɪn/}}v. 决定；确定；查明}}{{Scientists are trying to determine the cause of the disease.}}
{{develop}}{/dɪˈveləp/}}v. 发展；开发；冲洗（照片）}}{{The company plans to develop new products this year.}}
{{device}}{/dɪˈvaɪs/}}n. 装置；设备；策略}}{{A smartphone is a very useful electronic device.}}
{{devote}}{/dɪˈvəʊt/}}v. 致力于；奉献}}{{She devoted her life to helping the poor.}}
{{dialog}}{/ˈdaɪəlɒɡ/}}n. 对话；对白}}{{The dialog between the two leaders was very productive.}}
{{diamond}}{/ˈdaɪəmənd/}}n. 钻石；菱形}}{{The diamond ring cost a small fortune.}}
{{diary}}{/ˈdaɪəri/}}n. 日记；日记簿}}{{She keeps a diary and writes in it every night.}}
{{dictation}}{/dɪkˈteɪʃn/}}n. 听写；口述}}{{The teacher gave a dictation test in class today.}}
{{dictionary}}{/ˈdɪkʃəneri/}}n. 字典；词典}}{{Look up the word in the dictionary if you don't know it.}}
{{die}}{/daɪ/}}v. 死；消亡}}{{Many plants die without enough water and sunlight.}}
{{diet}}{/ˈdaɪət/}}n. 饮食；节食；v. 节食}}{{A balanced diet is important for good health.}}
{{differ}}{/ˈdɪfər/}}v. 不同；意见不同}}{{The two cultures differ in many ways.}}
{{difficulty}}{/ˈdɪfɪkəlti/}}n. 困难；难点}}{{She had no difficulty passing the entrance exam.}}
{{dig}}{/dɪɡ/}}v. 挖掘；探究}}{{They dug a hole in the garden to plant a tree.}}
{{digital}}{/ˈdɪdʒɪtl/}}adj. 数字的；数码的}}{{Digital technology has transformed the way we communicate.}}
{{dilemma}}{/dɪˈlemə/}}n. 困境；进退两难}}{{He faced a dilemma between career and family.}}
{{dimension}}{/dɪˈmenʃn/}}n. 维度；方面；尺寸}}{{The problem has both an economic and a social dimension.}}
{{dinner}}{/ˈdɪnər/}}n. 正餐；晚餐}}{{We had a delicious dinner at the new restaurant.}}
{{direct}}{/dəˈrekt/}}adj. 直接的；v. 指挥；导演}}{{The movie was directed by a famous filmmaker.}}
